        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of Florida, University of Texas System\n- People: Steven J. Kachelmeier\n- Places: Gainesville, Florida, Austin, Texas\n- Topics: higher education, university systems, academic degrees\n\nFacts:\n- The University of Florida is an American public land-grant, sea-grant, and space-grant research university on a 2,000-acre campus in Gainesville, Florida.\n- The University of Texas System is headquartered in Austin, Texas.\n- The University of Texas System has total enrollment of more than 216,000 students and is the largest university system in Texas.\n- The University of Texas System employs more than 87,000 faculty and staff.\n- Steven J. Kachelmeier received his B.B.A. from the University of New Mexico.\n- Steven J. Kachelmeier received his Ph.D. from the University of Florida.",
